#: docs/tablet-protocol.rst:2
msgid "Tablet pointer protocol"
msgstr "数位板指针协议"

#: docs/tablet-protocol.rst:6
msgid ""
"Pens and fingers carry far more than the mouse protocol can express: pressure, tilt, rotation of "
"the barrel, which end of the pen is in use, hovering, several fingers at once, the shape of each "
"finger on the glass. A tablet has keys, rings and dials of its own beside the pen. The tablet "
"pointer protocol is an open terminal extension that reports all of it, from graphics tablets, pen"
" displays, touchscreens and touchpads, with room for whatever a device measures. It belongs to no"
" terminal: silkie (this kitty fork) implements it and this page is its specification. The goals "
"are those of the other extensions here: small, unobtrusive, easy to implement, and no change to "
"what the TTY is."
msgstr ""
"笔和手指包含远超鼠标协议表达能力的信息：压力、倾斜、笔杆旋转、正在使用笔的哪一端、悬停、多个同时接触的手指，以及手指在玻璃上的形状。数位板在笔之外还有按键、触控环和旋钮。数位板指针协议是报告所有这些信息的开放终端扩展，支持绘图数位板、数位屏、触摸屏和触控板，并为设备测量的其他信息预留扩展空间。它不专属于任何终端：silkie（本"
" kitty 分支）实现了它，本页是其规范。目标与其他扩展相同：小巧、低干扰、易于实现，不改变 TTY 的本质。"

