" ``query``、``cap``、``mode``、``device``、``label`` 或 ``event``。"

#: docs/tablet-protocol.rst:30
msgid ""
"The protocol grows without a new version. Beyond what every extension ignores, a program ignores "
"a report whose ``kind`` it does not know and any bit of ``valid`` it does not know, and treats a "
"``tool`` value it does not know as ``0``. A new kind of report is sent only to a program that "
"asked for it with a mode bit of its own, so a program is never sent what it was not written for."
msgstr ""
"协议可在不升级版本的情况下扩展。除了各扩展共用的忽略规则外，程序还应忽略不认识 ``kind`` 的报告和不认识的 ``valid`` 位，将未知 ``tool`` 值视为 "
"``0``。新增报告种类只有在程序通过独立模式位请求后才发送，确保程序不会收到其设计时无法处理的种类。"

