msgstr "不带 ``mode`` 字段的 ``mode`` 请求读取状态而不修改，回复为：::"

#: docs/tablet-protocol.rst:127
msgid ""
"A terminal keeps only the bits it supports and that its user has not refused, so a program that "
"asked for more than it was given finds out by reading the mode back. A program resuming after a "
"reconnection reads the mode to learn whether it survived, rather than assuming it did."
msgstr "终端仅保留其支持且用户未拒绝的位，因此请求超出获准范围的程序可通过读回模式获知。程序重连后恢复时，应读回模式确认是否保留，而非假定状态仍在。"

